                        "entry_id": "a6452670-0deb-3c69-8959-4ab7d91b5292",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sailing about without an exact destination, especially for pleasure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0febde87-ce8b-43f5-b56b-4860240fd338",
                                "sense_id": "48f8b5ec-5258-32e8-a4b0-1f9c2f81a555",
                                "text": "Cruising is a popular activity among the over-60s."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35f2c61a-3530-405f-a5bd-569388bb24bb",
                                "sense_id": "48f8b5ec-5258-32e8-a4b0-1f9c2f81a555",
                                "text": "Maintenance time takes away from the time for sightseeing, fishing, reading, or the other things that were the original objectives of cruising."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a35dc7f0-e878-32c9-b92b-66a3fb7ad7bb",
                        "entry_id": "a6452670-0deb-3c69-8959-4ab7d91b5292",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Driving around without an exact destination, as a social activity."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad583c19-8972-4b36-8521-c660546fa9f9",
                                "sense_id": "a35dc7f0-e878-32c9-b92b-66a3fb7ad7bb",
                                "text": "Cruising was a popular pasttime for teens in this area at the time."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "17859390-ad57-3295-b207-d4250404b27c",
                        "entry_id": "a6452670-0deb-3c69-8959-4ab7d91b5292",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Walking unsteadily while holding onto objects such as furniture and walls: a stage in the development of ambulation (unassisted walking), typically occurring around age 10 months."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7df6bb61-a184-4974-970d-9db359df0060",
                                "sense_id": "17859390-ad57-3295-b207-d4250404b27c",
                                "text": "Cruising is a fun stage for the baby, even though there are going to be some mild falls and crying during the course of it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bf1ea18f-4a10-304d-a840-6ca882e67b83",
                        "entry_id": "a6452670-0deb-3c69-8959-4ab7d91b5292",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Walking or driving about a locality in search of a sex partner for casual sex, especially among gay men."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "slang",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a1008a4-4b1a-4952-822d-e996220a56ca",
                                "sense_id": "bf1ea18f-4a10-304d-a840-6ca882e67b83",
                                "text": "There was a fair amount of cruising going on at the gay party."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc6e2ad7-8964-4e97-99c8-f3dfd668da23",
                                "sense_id": "bf1ea18f-4a10-304d-a840-6ca882e67b83",
                                "text": "Within their [homosexuals'] own group, too, there is considerable social discrimination. In the most “respectable” class are those who do no “cruising,” i.e., picking up “friends” at random in the parks or streets."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "62910c20-83c4-4284-88fb-0ee4122ecf6b",
                                "sense_id": "bf1ea18f-4a10-304d-a840-6ca882e67b83",
                                "text": "The press screamed headlines about castrating perverts, but the parks and cruising places remained as populous as ever. And with good cause."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed6db91c-6dd6-420a-9021-fc9ac9a7e8b6",
                                "sense_id": "bf1ea18f-4a10-304d-a840-6ca882e67b83",
                                "text": "For example, when a homosexual goes cruising, he runs the risk of being arrested, blackmailed or beaten up. Therefore, [Bergler concludes] homosexuals want to be hurt, humiliated, defeated and destroyed; they are all psychic masochists."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e95c5ff4-5876-40f0-9efd-3407628912cd",
                                "sense_id": "bf1ea18f-4a10-304d-a840-6ca882e67b83",
                                "text": "But even so, the gay boys who are out cruising aren’t being especially cautious. They’ve even made a pickup gambit out of it. “If that bulge in your pants isn’t a knife, let’s go for a walk.” That sort of thing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c92d0dc-c2e1-460c-88d7-8a6f5629001d",
                                "sense_id": "bf1ea18f-4a10-304d-a840-6ca882e67b83",
                                "text": "Gay cruising in hotel bars was quiet and covert, but still charged with erotic possibilities and an awareness that there was little time to waste."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
